imple warmth", "keywords": ["nostalgia", "childhood", "innocence", "old friends"]}, "reversed": {"core": "Stuck in the past, or finally leaving it", "keywords": ["living in the past", "unrealistic", "moving forward", "growing up"]}}}, "cups_07": {"zh": {"key": "cups_07", "name": "圣杯七", "upright": {"core": "选项太多、幻想太多，看着都好但不一定是真的", "keywords": ["幻想", "选择", "诱惑", "白日梦"]}, "reversed": {"core": "雾散了，看清哪个才是真想要的", "keywords": ["看清", "做决定", "回到现实", "专注"]}}, "en": {"key": "cups_07", "name": "Seven of Cups", "upright": {"core": "Too many choices and daydreams; not all of them are real", "keywords": ["fantasy", "options", "illusion", "wishful thinking"]}, "reversed": {"core": "The haze clears; you see what you actually want", "keywords": ["clarity", "decision", "reality check", "focus"]}}}, "cups_08": {"zh": {"key": "cups_08", "name": "圣杯八", "upright": {"core": "转身离开，那里已经满足不了你了", "keywords": ["离开", "寻找", "放下", "更深的需要"]}, "reversed": {"core": "想走又不敢走，或走来走去在逃", "keywords": ["犹豫", "怕改变", "逃避", "留恋"]}}, "en": {"key": "cups_08", "name": "Eight of Cups", "upright": {"core": "Walking away from what no longer fills you", "keywords": ["departure", "seeking", "letting go", "deeper meaning"]}, "reversed": {"core": "Wanting to leave but afraid to, or drifting from place to place", "keywords": ["hesitation", "fear of change", "avoidance", "clinging"]}}}, "cups_09": {"zh": {"key": "cups_09", "name": "圣杯九", "upright": {"core": "心愿实现了，满足地享受一下", "keywords": ["满足", "心愿成真", "享受", "得意"]}, "reversed": {"core": "得到了却没那么开心，或享受过头", "keywords": ["不满足", "空虚", "放纵", "自满"]}}, "en": {"key": "cups_09", "name": "Nine of Cups", "upright": {"core": "The wish came true; enjoy it", "keywords": ["contentment", "wish fulfilled", "pleasure", "satisfaction"]}, "reversed": {"core": "Got it but not as happy as expected, or overindulging", "keywords": ["dissatisfaction", "hollowness", "excess", "smugness"]}}}, "cups_10": {"zh": {"key": "cups_10", "name": "圣杯十", "upright": {"core": "家里和睦、爱的人都在身边，心安", "keywords": ["圆满",